Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Princess Knight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eleventh Episode\NThe Spirit of Sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.22,0:02:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, are you coming to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.82,0:02:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.58,0:02:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's go!\N- Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.62,0:02:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why that sneaky look?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.78,0:02:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sneaky look?!\N- He's not doing anything wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.38,0:02:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember that you\Nare on vacation? You can play here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:03:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.50,0:03:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on vacation!\NWe can have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you are far from the\Npalace, don't let yourself go too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember the promises\Nthat you made to your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.66,0:03:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The first is to continue\Nto be good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.22,0:03:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is the second?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.78,0:03:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The second is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,To be patient\Nduring this week of vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...and curb my spirit\Nof adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.86,0:03:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't forget it!\N- Then, goodbye, Opal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close call! And who is this running\Ninto me?! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.38,0:03:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Esteemed Garigori, do you happen to know\Nwhere the Prince is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.50,0:03:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor, does this seem like\Nthe time to come disturbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. I have something\Ntoo important to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You can find the Prince\Non the hill,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.34,0:03:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but mind, next time,\Nnot to be so early!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, look at what a beautiful landscape!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We are the squires of the King!\NHow heavy this pleasure weighs!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.78,0:04:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Isn't that the King's throne?\N- Yes, it is my father's.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what is happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness! Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, return immediately\Nto your residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, because right now I'm playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You must obey me, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- What a pity...!\N- No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to wear it!\NWhy do I have to put on this dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for the ceremony you will have to\Ngo through because the King is sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who will I receive?\N- Lord Plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Plastic?!\NDo you mean Duralumin's son?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.26,0:04:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that stupid son of his!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet! If the Grand Duke hears you\Ntalking like that, he'll make you pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.94,0:04:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His promotion is being celebrated:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,after eight years in first grade, he was\Npromoted to second grade...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.38,0:05:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight years for him to pass\Nfirst grade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.42,0:05:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,His Excellency\Nthe Grand Duke Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He is proud of his son
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't hurt yourself, Plastic?\NDon't worry, everything is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.38,0:05:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, now go up the grand staircase\Nand greet them as they taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Show everyone that you are\Nmuch better than Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, did you teach him\Nthe protocol?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, perfectly!\N- Here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Plastic! How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hi! - Prince, I ask you\Nto receive my son...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.74,0:05:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...according to tradition.\N- I wanted to congratulate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.10,0:05:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I thank you on his\Nbehalf! Did you hear, Plastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.74,0:06:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- Answer the Prince.\N- I'm going to answer! I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! You are not\Ngoing the right way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the Prince,\Nyou must turn to the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.06,0:06:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no!\N- To the right...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you teach him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.42,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There is nothing to laugh about!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's skip the\Nformalities and go play.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke, I'm\Ntaking Plastic to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He who laughs last laughs best,\NPrince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.10,0:06:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that, during the meal,\Nyou must behave properly at the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must use a fork and knife,\Nnot your hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.70,0:06:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,you must remain seated\Nand not pick your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.70,0:06:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't throw breadcrumbs!\NYou must che...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Chew with your mouth closed, don't make\Nrude noises and don't start crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.10,0:06:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, what a struggle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, what a struggle\Nteaching this blockhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you get all of that through your thick skull?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- I am so sorry, Grand Duke!\N- What are you doing, you complete idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.86,0:07:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just pleasantly surprised\Nby your son's intelligence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.66,0:07:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true! My son, after all,\Nis very intelligent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I propose a toast\Nto Plastic's promotion! Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.18,0:07:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bravo!\N- Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.70,0:07:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not allow Sapphire\Nto sit on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he pretends to be\Na boy, she is a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And since the law of this land\Nforbids a girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...to ascend the throne,\Nif I manage to get rid of the Prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.62,0:07:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,then the throne will be Plastic's!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, since I\Nam the King's only brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you have every right to it,\Nmy son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Should people take him\Nfor a blockhead? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will seat him on the throne\Nat all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic, where are you going? I'm coming with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.22,0:08:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehi, Plastic! Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.78,0:08:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Why don't we play?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're here,\Nlet's play together, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How beautiful! I like these\Nso much! They are so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to take them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.22,0:08:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a painting! You\Ncan't eat painted things!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.14,0:08:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want to eat it!\N- This strawberry looks real..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...because it is painted very well,\Nbut you can't pull it off of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.54,0:08:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- I want to eat it! I want it!\N- Don't throw a tantrum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.86,0:08:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a painting! Oh, good\Nheavens, now he got angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.86,0:08:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize!\NPlastic, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.74,0:08:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to eat it!\NI want the strawberries!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible! It's\Nsummer now, Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:08:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Strawberries only\Ngrow in spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a strawberry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke! Your son will be\Nable to eat strawberries, even if...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.74,0:09:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean we can\Nget some strawberries?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely! In the middle of the\Nwoods, strawberries also grow in summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.46,0:09:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go pick them right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You will have them sooner than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.06,0:09:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent some\Nsoldiers to pick them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.06,0:09:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I told them that\Nthis spoiled boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...who is asking for strawberries\Nout of season is Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You did well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.62,0:09:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that whoever returns with the\Nstrawberries will get a handsome reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.30,0:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- I will get that reward!\N- No, I'll be the one to win it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.14,0:09:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- I will find them!\N- That prize will be mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.46,0:09:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who is pushing me?\N- Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Fire!\N- Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.74,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.02,0:10:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch where you're going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.10,0:10:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! A monster!\N- Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.30,0:10:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Another monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.82,0:11:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth: you didn't\Nexpect these wonders, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- But that's the devil!\N- Who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.02,0:11:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools! Your weapons\Nare useless against me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,spirit of sleep! I will punish you\Nfor staying awake tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Wake up, sprite!\N- Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Give me the sleep powder!\N- Right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.38,0:11:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Powder of anger,\Npowder of tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.14,0:11:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,powder of laughter,\Npowder of sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it is! To you, little brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.50,0:11:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will punish you! Fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.02,0:11:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't keep\Nmy eyes open...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The powder has no effect on me,\Nbecause I am an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.54,0:11:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can resist sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who sent you to disturb\Nthe peace of the forest tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Prince Sapphire!\NSuddenly he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,..that he wanted to eat\Nsome strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.98,0:12:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire... I know him,\Nbecause he often comes to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.74,0:12:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sprite, how can I punish him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.42,0:12:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my dear Plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a little patience!\NLet's do a test.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.90,0:12:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see\Nhow you look on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.62,0:12:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You are incompetent!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to sit on the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you look so good\Non that throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems made just for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One of these days, you will be sitting\Nthere with the crown on your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:13:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And it will be all thanks to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.62,0:13:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, mother, I will try to\Nbe diligent! Just as you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!\NI will be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.06,0:13:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't get angry! I won't fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.18,0:13:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Spoiled prince! The spirit of\Nsleep has come to punish you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.66,0:13:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...for your tantrums, which have\Ndisturbed the peace of the forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!\NHe is fast asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.50,0:13:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I certainly cannot punish someone\Nwho is sleeping! I'll have to wake him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.42,0:13:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will do just... that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey! Who is it?!\N- I am the spirit of sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.70,0:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make sure that you\Ncan no longer sleep! There!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to give me this punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pretend you don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.26,0:13:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You woke up\Nthe entire forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.46,0:13:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Take this!\N- No, it's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.30,0:13:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Didn't you want the strawberries?\N- I assure you, I didn't ask for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,May I know who wanted them,\Nthen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.18,0:14:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...\NI can't tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.46,0:14:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're making fun of me, aren't you?\N- What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.54,0:14:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If he won't say it, I will! It was\NPlastic who wanted the strawberries!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! And so it was\NPlastic! I must go punish him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, if you do anything to\NPlastic, I won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.02,0:14:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, little one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.54,0:14:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, wait!\N- Then so much the worse for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit of the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,See how it doesn't pay\Nto go against me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want war,\Nyou'll have it! Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.54,0:14:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't continue! I promised my\Nmother that I wouldn't get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:15:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help!\N- If you hadn't wanted to hit me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.58,0:15:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- you wouldn't have fallen.\N- Poor elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Aren't you ashamed to mistreat\Nsuch a small child?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.34,0:15:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to mistreat him! He suddenly\Ntried to hit me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,so I took a step to the side\Nand he fell!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.70,0:15:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, little elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway,\Nhe deserves a punishment too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make sure\Nthat he doesn't wake up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he has lost consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.66,0:15:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I will forgive him!\NCome with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to eat strawberries!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is! Did you see? It's that one over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.30,0:15:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Grand Duke! Little Grand Duke!\N- Who wants me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Little Grand Duke! Tiny Grand Duke!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.18,0:15:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But... But who is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.30,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, spoiled brat! Do you know\Nthat they ruined the sleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...of all the forest inhabitants\Nbecause of your tantrums?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's there to laugh about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As a punishment\Nfor your insolence,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.90,0:16:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I will stop you from sleeping forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.14,0:16:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Plastic! What happened to you,\Nmy son?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.42,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The soldiers didn't\Nfind the strawberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.62,0:16:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about\Nthis nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know. It's his\Nhead that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It is beyond my power\Nto cure an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of curing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.62,0:16:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now close your eyes gently! You are sleepy!\NYou are getting sleepier and sleepier!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so sleepy! You\Ncan't wait to go to bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.10,0:17:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I command you to close\Nthose goddamned eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Obey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, my dear child! Close them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is Plastic here?\N- What do you want, Prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin, perhaps I can cure him.\NJust a moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.82,0:17:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Opal!\N- Your Highness, where do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go into the forest\Nto look for the spirit of sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.58,0:17:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you go! It could\Ndo to you what it did to Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be fine.\NPlastic cannot stay like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.54,0:17:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know that Plastic\Nis your enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true!\NHe is the son of Duralumin
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.94,0:17:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the Grand Duke wants him to\Nascend the throne in your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- You know it well! Don't help him!\N- Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.58,0:17:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit of sleep!\NSpirit of sleep, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.18,0:17:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, spirit? Little spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.26,0:18:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit of sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Spirit of sleep, please!\N- What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you come to get\Nrevenge for the other night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.78,0:18:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkness, fall! - I didn't come\Nto get my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot fight\Nif it isn't dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's pitch black!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,More brushwood! Yes!\NMake him dance some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- A little more!\N- Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.26,0:18:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! Stop! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.46,0:18:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, enough! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.78,0:18:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, turn Plastic\Nback to how he was!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.26,0:18:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- No way!\N- I am so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.14,0:18:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...about the soldiers.\NYou're right, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.46,0:18:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying that to me\Nbecause you're so afraid of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.14,0:18:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't... Oh, no! I\Npromised not to get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.42,0:18:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pixie, teach him a little lesson.\N- At your command!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I slept...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, now I remember! You\Nwere the one who put me to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- And who the hell are you?\N- That's what I'm asking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- You are very impertinent!\N- No, you're the impertinent one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You are very impertinent!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it that Sapphire takes all\Nof this and hasn't gotten angry yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.78,0:19:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.74,0:19:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,In those jars there\Nis magic powder!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coward! It's\Nunbelievable that he's a Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the anger powder. Which\None is it? Ah, here, it's this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I feel really angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.74,0:19:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's over? Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.62,0:19:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even have the\Nstrength to stand on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.46,0:20:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still provoking me?\NToo bad for you, spirit of sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I will challenge you to a duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.82,0:20:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? Where did\Nyou put all your fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.26,0:20:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this! And this! And this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.22,0:20:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sprite, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.94,0:20:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's settle the\Nscore... Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now will you come and cure Plastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,No! It's useless to threaten me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.86,0:20:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me how\NI can cure Plastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me like\Nthat, I will never tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.42,0:20:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do what I ask\Nof you, then I'll tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.10,0:20:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- I accept!\N- Then kneel on the ground and beg me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.82,0:20:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want me\Nto get down on my knees?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.42,0:20:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I said:\Nkneel and beg me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.42,0:21:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? You can't do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.74,0:21:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A Prince never stoops\Nto such things!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you,\Nshow me what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.86,0:21:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How amusing! A Prince\Nkneeling before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.78,0:21:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me if he looks like a Prince to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.30,0:21:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's begging me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.22,0:21:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Now I...\N- Isn't this enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, now I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must be crazy to do\Nsuch things for another person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor son!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.22,0:21:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can cure him!\N- What is that jar?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you hurt my baby...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.86,0:22:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the powder that will make\Nhim go back to how he was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He has woken up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.66,0:22:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I am happy to see\Nthat you are well again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, I have\Nno words to thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.18,0:22:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! What I did I\Ncertainly didn't do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.70,0:22:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand Duke, here is the powder\Nthat always keeps one awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.34,0:22:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want him to be sick again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.30,0:22:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But I got it to put it\Non the Prince! What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.58,0:22:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- On Sapphire?\N- Yes! There is no need
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.42,0:22:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...to thank him too much just\Nbecause he saved your son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.30,0:22:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in the forest while he\Nwas asking the spirit what to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.66,0:22:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I saw\Nthat he didn't try all that hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not forget\Nthat, as long as the Prince is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.94,0:22:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,your son will not be able to\Nsit on the throne!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:22:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, for a while\NI had forgotten it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.62,0:23:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!\NI know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.62,0:23:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, friend! I was just\Ndreaming that you were saving me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.90,0:23:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have such foolish dreams!\NYou must sleep soundly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.82,0:23:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there is still\Nany child awake..!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.18,0:23:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to do a patrol.\NGoodnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sleep well, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.26,0:24:40.88,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:44.24,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:44.24,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.24,0:24:48.01,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k29}{\k22}Ta{\k18}ra{\k16}ri {\k18}Ra{\k20}tta {\k23}Ri{\k19}tta {\k26}Ra{\k17}tta {\k19}Ra{\k66}tta{\k69}ttaa
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.01,0:24:51.17,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k8}{\k46}Kya{\k68}hoo! {\k35}Kya{\k42}hoo! {\k46}Kya{\k91}hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.01,0:24:51.17,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:54.99,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k41}{\k46}Sen{\k38}'nen {\k52}man{\k41}'nen {\k34}hya{\k25}ku{\k33}man{\k38}-nen{\k33}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.18,0:24:54.99,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.99,0:24:58.29,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k11}{\k47}Rib{\k27}bon {\k25}de {\k33}tsu{\k22}na{\k13}go{\k23}u {\k19}i{\k30}chi{\k19}o{\k7}ku{\k54}-nen
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.99,0:24:58.29,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.29,0:25:02.29,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k33}{\k33}A{\k22}ku{\k25}ma {\k17}ga {\k35}ku{\k36}te {\k24}mo {\k19}a{\k18}ra{\k30}shi {\k11}ga {\k36}ku{\k33}te {\k28}mo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.29,0:25:02.29,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,
